# Optional. When set, overrides the deploy sub-path everywhere
# (vite `base`, router basename, runtime data URLs, 404 fallback).
# Examples:
#   VITE_BASENAME=/LANDAGRI-B_Dashboard   # default (gh-pages project page)
#   VITE_BASENAME=/                        # root domain / custom domain
# Leave unset for: `/` in `vite dev`, `/LANDAGRI-B_Dashboard` in `vite build`.
# Never put secrets here — this value is baked into the client bundle.
#VITE_BASENAME=
